      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Concept and style plates\n\nOne Run, two Versions: a scene concept and a style plate. Root name makes them two streams on one\nentity, `{entity}_concept` and `{entity}_style`.\n\nRun this before 02. 02 loads the newest of each.\n\nRun as it is: both images preview, nothing is sent until each Publish has a project and a link.\n\nEach Version records prompt, seed, model, sampler, steps and cfg off the graph. Change a seed, Run\nagain: v002 on the same stream.\n\nFlux dev, 20 steps, 1280x720. Guidance is how hard the prompt pulls; cfg stays 1.0. The style\nplate is small on purpose: Redux resizes it to 384."
      ]
    },
